It seems odd to be using SPECIAL_PERMS so much when I would expect
dma's own makefiles to install with the right user/group/perms.
(pkgsrc install doesn't set these, but instead adds them to METALOG
and then the tarball uses that; this is the normal pattern).  Maybe
upstream just doesn't do this, but it seems odd, and it seems like a
workaroudnd for the DMA_ROOT_USER not being root.

